{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103730","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103730","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710373001:1":{"text":"几位大人，你们刚刚说的事是真的吗？在圣古堂内遭遇了魔物？！","source_cn":"几位大人，你们刚刚说的事是真的吗？在圣古堂内遭遇了魔物？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8100198A84554AE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710373002:1":{"text":"真的不能再真了！我们被魔物包围了，本来以为死定了……但我……咳咳，我临危不乱，一直在给其他人鼓劲！","source_cn":"真的不能再真了！我们被魔物包围了，本来以为死定了……但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6401CA5B12C6E7B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710373003:1":{"text":"噢，闭嘴吧坦尼斯！是神迹！明明是罗兰大帝显灵了！","source_cn":"噢，闭嘴吧坦尼斯！是神迹！明明是罗兰大帝显灵了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5125D38038A3E55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710373004:1":{"text":"在那绝望的时刻，是罗兰大帝的英灵驾驭着石中剑，清除了魔物，把我们从那个鬼地方送了回来！","source_cn":"在那绝望的时刻，是罗兰大帝的英灵驾驭着石中剑，清除了魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23BF6636ACE43DC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710373005:1":{"text":"那个……卡佩洛伯爵，请等一下。您说大家都救回来了……可是，这里只有你们三位啊？","source_cn":"那个……卡佩洛伯爵，请等一下。您说大家都救回来了……可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0BA3234026C51B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710373006:1":{"text":"什么？！","source_cn":"什么？！<key:dialog4>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5CA5C1796507826","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710373007:1":{"text":"佩吉公主呢？还有其他消失的贵族们呢？","source_cn":"佩吉公主呢？还有其他消失的贵族们呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA781CAF69728E33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710373008:1":{"text":"我……我不知道！刚才光芒亮起的时候，公主就在附近啊……","source_cn":"我……我不知道！刚才光芒亮起的时候，公主就在附近啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3D9AA8881F57B2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710373009:1":{"text":"她……她明明是为了救我们才冲上去拔剑的……","source_cn":"她……她明明是为了救我们才冲上去拔剑的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE245B76306B4C92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710373010:1":{"text":"冲上去拔剑？那结果呢？公主拔出石中剑了吗？","source_cn":"冲上去拔剑？那结果呢？公主拔出石中剑了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAC10FFCFFCD401D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710373011:1":{"text":"……很遗憾，那把剑并没有回应她。","source_cn":"……很遗憾，那把剑并没有回应她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D042DD675F2C605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710373012:1":{"text":"没有回应？！您是说，公主殿下没能拔出石中剑？","source_cn":"没有回应？！您是说，公主殿下没能拔出石中剑？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x052F5198EAA3B7B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710373013:1":{"text":"作为亲历者，我必须诚实地陈述那一刻的事实——","source_cn":"作为亲历者，我必须诚实地陈述那一刻的事实——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x674EB98D449531BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710373014:1":{"text":"当魔物袭来，我们危在旦夕之时，佩吉公主殿下确实第一时间尝试了拔剑。","source_cn":"当魔物袭来，我们危在旦夕之时，佩吉公主殿下确实第一时间...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1C2518E1CB6CABC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710373015:1":{"text":"但……无论她如何努力，那柄象征着王权的石中剑都没因她而动摇。","source_cn":"但……无论她如何努力，那柄象征着王权的石中剑都没因她而动摇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF44D8E38C6D8B23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710373016:1":{"text":"最后，是剑自己出鞘，用神圣的光芒清除魔物，并将我们这些无辜者送了回来。","source_cn":"最后，是剑自己出鞘，用神圣的光芒清除魔物，并将我们这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11F3A6E04E0D8480","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710373017:1":{"text":"其他人、其他人一定跟我们一样回来了，只是没在一起……吧？","source_cn":"其他人、其他人一定跟我们一样回来了，只是没在一起……吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C94F60AF6AFB61B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:探听消息的记者":{"text":"探听消息的记者","source":"探听消息的记者","status":"source"},"speaker:伯爵坦尼斯":{"text":"伯爵坦尼斯","source":"伯爵坦尼斯","status":"source"},"speaker:女伯爵卡佩洛":{"text":"女伯爵卡佩洛","source":"女伯爵卡佩洛","status":"source"},"speaker:好奇的民众":{"text":"好奇的民众","source":"好奇的民众","status":"source"},"speaker:报社主编伦道夫":{"text":"报社主编伦道夫","source":"报社主编伦道夫","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":5}}